        "explanation_ar": "feel + صفة = الإحساس بها على الجسم (مريح، ضيق). look + صفة = شكلها.",
        "explanation_en": "\"Feel\" = how it is on your body. \"Look\" = how it seems to the eyes.",
        "examples": [
          {
            "word": "feel",
            "sentence": "They feel comfortable."
          },
          {
            "word": "look",
            "sentence": "They look perfect."
          }
